          "id": "volume4a-tail-061",
          "section": "7.2.1.5",
          "cnPdfPage": 380,
          "enPdfPages": [
            456
          ],
          "location": "习题63(c)严格不等式的非零系数范围",
          "original": "当 $k\\leq\\mu$ 时，$a_{k-1}<a_k$；当 $k\\geq\\mu$ 时，$a_{k+1}<a_k$",
          "final": "当 $a_k\\ne0$ 时，若 $k\\leq\\mu$，则 $a_{k-1}<a_k$；若 $k\\geq\\mu$，则 $a_{k+1}<a_k$",
          "basis": "两版(c)都省略(a)(b)的a_k≠0，原答(c)直接归约到这两项。f(x)=x²的根均实且系数非负，μ=2、k=1时原式要求0<0。补同一前提即可，峰位结论保持。",
          "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
          "isProjectMathematicalCorrection": true,
          "pageMarkdownSha256": "0fb6efd23444cb3c1d05fe34e6eb1ef96949599db94d20165112c7da8030d3cb",
          "cnPrintedPage": 365
        },
        {
          "id": "volume4a-tail-062",
          "section": "7.2.1.5",
          "cnPdfPage": 380,
          "enPdfPages": [
            457
          ],
          "location": "习题80的循环要求",
          "original": "的分划是存在通用序列的",
          "final": "的分划就存在循环通用序列",
          "basis": "英文明确 universal cycles，题79(iv)给出了相应闭环条件，后续原答区分一般通用序列与通用循环。",
          "isAuthorOfficialErratum": false,
          "pageMarkdownSha256": "0fb6efd23444cb3c1d05fe34e6eb1ef96949599db94d20165112c7da8030d3cb",
          "cnPrintedPage": 365
        },
